## [PATTERN:CLEAN-ARCH] Architecture Pattern: Clean Architecture + DDD
<!-- SECTION:clean_arch -->

```
Presentation (API/UI) → Application (Services) → Domain (Entities/Protocols)
                                    ↓
                          Infrastructure (Repos/DB/External)
```

**Layer rules — flag violations HIGH severity:**
- Domain layer has ZERO external dependencies — no presentation framework or external DB-specific framework imports
- Application services must NOT import from the infrastructure layer directly; use DI via interfaces
- Repositories/Adapters are the only code that touches database sessions/connections
- Presentation layer/Routers must NOT call database sessions or transaction commits directly

