## [RULE:RBAC-HIERARCHY] RBAC Role Hierarchy
<!-- SECTION:rbac -->

```
SYSTEM_ADMIN > MANAGER > STAFF > USER
```

- `SYSTEM_ADMIN`: short-circuits all permission checks; global platform access
- `MANAGER` / `STAFF`: scoped to their assigned boundaries
- `USER`: self-service only

**New mutating endpoints must use standard permission checks**, not raw role-string comparisons.

---

## [RULE:MASS-ASSIGNMENT] Mass Assignment Protection
<!-- SECTION:mass_assignment -->

All input schemas (`*Create`, `*Update` request bodies) must set:

```python
model_config = {"extra": "forbid"}
```

A new input schema missing this allows property injection via the API — MEDIUM severity.

