## [RULE:MIGRATION-SAFETY] Migration Conventions
<!-- SECTION:migrations -->

- Migrations MUST be idempotent (use `if_exists`/`if_not_exists` guards)
- Drops MUST respect FK dependency order (drop referencing tables first)
- Every migration MUST have a working rollback path
- `NOT NULL` column additions to populated tables require a default value or split migration
- Never modify a migration that has been deployed — create a new one

